# C# conventions (analyzers are errors)

Build already fails on CA/IDE issues (`TreatWarningsAsErrors`, `AnalysisMode=All`). Do not silence analyzers or widen suppressions to get green.

## Prefer these patterns

- Results: `using static VideoAbridge.Core.Results;` then `Ok(...)` / `Fail<T>(...)`
- Awaits: `ConfigureAwait(true)` on UI continuations; `ConfigureAwait(false)` in Core/FFmpeg
- Suppressions only for WPF/XAML public surface (`CA1515`) or LibVLC dispose off the UI thread (`CA2213`) — match existing `AssemblyInfo` / field justifications
